{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1357762029"}, "name":{"label":"Diehrbcoaphbs"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-20T15:58:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"99.0"}, "id":{"label":"12444329523"}, "title":{"label":"Pointless app based questionnaire"}, "content":{"label":"I’m sure the app does great for people who have the excess money and time to pay for this kind of thing, however I was only interested at first as it seemed like a decent way to take your mind off of the urges of need to engage in pornographic material, breathing exercises etc. but it gives you a questionnaire to “build a report” that you then have to pay to view it before you can use the app? Not worth it in my opinion. Apps like these should have a statement before you download saying that they make you pay to use the app rather than offer in app purchases as it’s borderline scamming, false advertising and a waste of time", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"9"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"9"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1328089935"}, "name":{"label":"Kæye"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-10T18:59:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"95.0"}, "id":{"label":"12296526568"}, "title":{"label":"Dear Developers"}, "content":{"label":"I have a grievance to give.\n\nYou have made a feature where there are milestones in which one can attain and you have labelled this under the title of 'Achievements'.\n\nThe feature in itself is a great idea but its functionality is lacking.\n\nI do not believe that it is correct that we cannot display the achievement of our choosing.\n\nEspecially when, after you have reset your counter, the achievements functions fall into error and stay at the point that you last accomplished (so your very first streak).\n\nBefore my first relapse I made my way to the ‘Fortress’ achievement. \n\nBut I have now worked my way up and surpassed that, now accomplishing ‘Guardian’.\n\nBut it is as if my efforts have not been rightly awarded as I cannot even display this achievement because it is stuck on the ‘Fortress’. I can see that ‘Guardian’ has been achieved but I just cannot select to display it. \n\nThis issues cannot even be mitigated because as I said, you do not offer the feature to select the 'achievement' in which one wants to display.\n\nI would like to be able to open my app and be hit with the tangible success of my efforts, rather than to be stuck on a previous milestone.\n\nWhy have a trophy selection and be forced to only display the one someone else has chosen for you. Where is the autonomy?\n\nAre these not my trophies? Should I not have a say in the ones that I would like to display?\n\nP.S. January has passed and the videos have not been made accessible to the public yet? May I ask what is the hold up?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
